Display filters         (emulatorjs/src/shaders.js — part of the EmulatorJS 4.2.3 package above, unmodified)
  GLSL ports of libretro shaders (https://github.com/libretro/glsl-shaders), base64-embedded. The page
  passes three of them to EmulatorJS for 「画面」 / Display (the fourth option, Pixel, is no filter); the
  rest of the file ships as-is, unused.
    bicubic             Copyright (C) 2010 Team XBMC, (C) 2011 Stefanos A. — GPL-2.0-or-later (the
                        embedded port omits the header; the libretro upstream carries it)
    sabr                SABR v3.0, Joshua Street, portions from Hyllian's 5xBR v3.7c — GPL-2.0-or-later
    crt-easymode        CRT Shader by EasyMode — "License: GPL"
  Other presets in the file, not used by this page: 2xScaleHQ / 4xScaleHQ (guest(r), GPL-2.0-or-later),
  crt-geom (cgwg, Themaister, DOLLS, GPL-2.0-or-later), crt-aperture (EasyMode, GPL), mix-frames
  (GPL-2.0-or-later), crt-mattias, crt-beam, crt-caligari, crt-lottes, crt-zfast, crt-yeetron (no licence
  header in the port; see the libretro glsl-shaders repository).
  GPL-2.0-or-later is compatible with the GPL-3.0 terms the extension is distributed under.

